Tasks
Task 1: Scenario Decomposition (Architecture Phase)
Select this risk scenario: "Unauthorized access to a cloud-hosted patient records database due to compromised third-party vendor credentials."

Decompose it into FAIR factors. Document your reasoning in a markdown cell in Jupyter:

Loss Event Frequency (LEF) = Threat Event Frequency (TEF) x Vulnerability
Vulnerability = f(Threat Capability, Control/Resistance Strength)
Loss Magnitude (LM) = Primary Loss + Secondary Loss
Primary: incident response, legal, system recovery
Secondary: regulatory fines (consider GCC data protection frameworks, e.g., PDPL/UAE, SAMA/KSA), reputational damage, customer attrition
Deliverable: a factor table (CSV or dict) with min/most-likely/max estimates for each node, justified with assumptions (calibrated estimation, not guesses).

